Welcome to Team Ignition's private repository.
We will be using this to host any testing builds that we do not want
publicly accessible, as well as anything else we may se fit to host.
This is to ensure that we don't have to deal with support nightmares.

So, check in process:
0) Get frustro to add you. This HAS to be done.
git clone git@github.com:servergod/team-ignition.git
// this will greate a folder called "team-ignition" with this README in it
cd team-ignition
nano README 
// or whatever editor you use, gedit works fine too
Now add your username below! Then,
git add README
git commit -m 'username first commit'
// replace your username
git push origin master

